Third-party rules and materials
------------------------------

The MIT license above covers this project's original contributions. It does
not replace the licenses of attributed third-party rules, images, or other
materials. See docs/sources.md and the relevant source and asset notes.

book/34-shared-stories.md and docs/evidence/F32-action-and-consequences.md
include Chinese paraphrases and adaptations of selected Blades in the Dark
SRD rules. The fictional examples and probability calculations are original
to this project. No game setting, artwork, maps, or logos are reproduced.

This work is based on Blades in the Dark (found at http://www.bladesinthedark.com/), product of One Seven Design, developed and authored by John Harper, and licensed for our use under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported license (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).

book/34-shared-stories.md and docs/evidence/F33-aspects-and-shared-fiction.md
include Chinese paraphrases and adaptations of selected Fate Condensed
official SRD text. Fate Condensed (c) 2020 Evil Hat Productions, LLC.
The fictional examples and value arguments are original to this project.

This work is based on Fate Condensed (found at http://www.faterpg.com/), a product of Evil Hat Productions, LLC, developed, authored, and edited by PK Sullivan, Lara Turner, Leonard Balsera, Fred Hicks, Richard Bellingham, Robert Hanz, Ryan Macklin, and Sophie Lagacé, and licensed for our use under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported license (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).

These adaptations are not official translations. Neither rights holder has
reviewed, endorsed, or sponsored this project. No trademark or logo license
is implied by the project's MIT license.
